@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title Native filemanager - import entry
actor Teacher
participant "Native filemanager" as Manager
participant "Moodle picker" as Picker
participant "Scoped browser" as Browser
Teacher -> Manager : Import materials
Manager -> Picker : Open Add file; select CourseBridge
Picker -> Browser : Embed documented HTML chooser
Browser --> Teacher : Filters, folders and checkbox cards
note over Manager, Browser
The pending native form stays open.
Folder Edit-content needs managefiles,
not activity Settings permission.
end note
@enduml
